    "why": "Energy now ranks the section I labelled 'verse' (16.00-31.24) as the highest in the song at 0.90, above both drops. Either the label is wrong and that is a chorus, or the boundary is. Separately, the stretch I called one continuous 'drop' from 63.62 to 107.43 has a clear energy dip to 0.40 around 84-88 s, which usually means a vocal section sits between two chorus passes and there is a boundary I missed near 78 and 92."
